        "frequency": "annual",
        "calendar": "fiscal",
        "methodology": "Academic-year totals reproduced from the Open Doors 2025 Iran country fact sheet. The contract's fiscal calendar category is used for an academic reporting year spanning two Gregorian calendar years; it is not an Iranian fiscal or Solar Hijri year. The integer year denotes the starting year of the academic-year label. Exact national period boundaries are not specified in the inspected fact sheet, so Gregorian boundaries remain null. Open Doors 2021–2023, corresponding to academic years 2020/21–2022/23, broadened coverage to include remote enrollment from outside the United States. Beginning with Open Doors 2024, corresponding to 2023/24, that coverage was removed. Totals are reported populations, not annual migration flows, new visa issuances, or permanent emigrants. Observation status observed means reported survey totals, not a complete administrative census of all Iranian migrants.",
